ons and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":178541,"global_rank":425099},{"name":"stevengum/arm-templates-for-samples","owner":"stevengum","html_url":"https://github.com/stevengum/arm-templates-for-samples","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"For soliciting feedback on ARM templates","topics":[],"score":178538,"global_rank":425100},{"name":"74hc595/Arduino-For-Kids","owner":"74hc595","html_url":"https://github.com/74hc595/Arduino-For-Kids","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A proposal for a more kid-friendly Arduino IDE based on the Logo language","topics":[],"score":178535,"global_rank":425102},{"name":"BionIT/homepage-plugin","owner":"BionIT","html_url":"https://github.com/BionIT/homepage-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":178534,"global_rank":425103},{"name":"caternuson/doxy2sphinx","owner":"caternuson","html_url":"https://github.com/caternuson/doxy2sphinx","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Test repo for doxgen/sphinx/breathe.","topics":[],"score":178534,"global_rank":425104},{"name":"jeffsilverm/vault_API_demos","owner":"jeffsilverm","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffsilverm/vault_API_demos","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"I am learning how to use the vault API","topics":[],"score":178534,"global_rank":425105},{"name":"bion/nrt","owner":"bion","html_url":"https://github.com/bion/nrt","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"SuperCollider","description":"non-realtime supercollider tools","topics":[],"score":178534,"global_rank":425107},{"name":"ha